WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Forget it, Miss Chen

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,920
As soon as I get sick, I go to work and spread the word.

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,220
They will say that I am inhumane Lin Feng

4
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:10,060
I am also responsible for getting out quickly.

5
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:12,220
I remember everything I owe you

6
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,310
Just think of me as atonement for myself

7
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:17,820
There may be speakers recently

8
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:39,980
Help me move the firewood into the cave to prevent it from ending, okay?

9
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:42,230
Finally a strong emotion came out

10
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:50,210
When your illness is over, he will let you work

11
00:00:50,410 --> 00:00:51,570
It's so inhumane

12
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:52,690
Lin Feng didn’t force me

13
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,790
I asked for this myself

14
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:58,780
I'll be free to do it myself from today on

15
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:00,140
Worksheet reset

16
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:04,820
Chaiguo water collection and inspection are extended to one person per post

17
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:07,180
Everyone has their own share of all resources

18
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:08,420
Stop centimeters in exchange

19
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:10,660
If anyone is wondering or talking

20
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:12,700
Others can vote

21
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:14,500
expel him from camp
